Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI'd want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world\NThere is a place that I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to take you to Let's head\Nforward then But as for the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we already know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Mama,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, what a cute little creature\Nyou are. You're all bones and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you're inexplicably alive.\NIt's a miracle. And my goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you put up quite the impressive\Nfight back there why the Chess
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Peacekeepers couldn't hold a\Ncandle to your little jam session.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't call you Soul King for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is like poison to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you're still no\Nmatch for these three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With good reason, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them life with my own soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So these guys are on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, we have completed the inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We checked all his clothes\Nand didn't find a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the inside of his tube\Nhere is empty as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the sword here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing hiding in his cloak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Z-zilch. Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't take anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very delighted to\Nhear that, Soul King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to have\Nsuspected you, my pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this little pet peeve, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have you going and\Ntouching my Tomate box or
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,snooping around making copies\Nof my Poneglyph either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be a certified fool to carelessly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,allow another person to\Nmake it to Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to screw it up like\NI did with Roger, believe you, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He used that strange\Npower of his to hear the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,voice of all things and\Ninterpret the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But fortunately for us, we have someone\Nwho will eventually have a similar ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates who reach\NLaugh Tale next will be us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you dare forget that mama
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,hmm oh my sweet pudding speak
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:05:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of the devil you need something\Ndid your third eye open it's only
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,a matter of time my dear mama\Ncome on is that all you ever want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to talk about with me i'm just\Na half-blood anyway there's no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,guarantee that my power will ever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaken. I apologize. Your mama is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,just a bit excited as all you\Nhave that rare three-eyed people's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,blood in your veins if those\Nspecial powers don't ever come to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fruition then you're just a\Ncreepy-looking weirdo. Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma ma ma ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,P-P-Ponin has three eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret that we know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that skeleton man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect him to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least he got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling shy and what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak to you\Nin your room, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sweetheart, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a father into his third form?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Count Iwatori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better finish this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,From Baron Tamako to Vikao Niyoko,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and now to Count Niwatori—each\Ntime he gets cracked open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These are his egg, egg\Nfruit powers in this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be invincible, a\Ntrue knight among knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he hatches, he'll possess\Npower that you can only dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys—we gotta stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not gonna wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna wait
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to have so many soldiers around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, you crazy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugarra fell for the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Any later and you could\Nhave been killed, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, I didn't expect\Nthat out of you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.60,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you, Karoo, even imagine how I felt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of how alarming it is to\Nbe screamed at from a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, Tia, came up with\Nthis great plan in the snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our Pedro. Great job. Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of mirror dimension?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be the first\Nsurprise I've seen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's cool is no one can\Nenter or leave without Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means we'll have an easy\Nescape route once we track down Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, can you\Nfill us in on what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.\NWorried about Brook, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope you got a copy of\Nthat stone without much trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you finished drawing\Neveryone's portrait yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go, Cho-Bro.\NOh, really? Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show the mirrors what you drew\Nand ask them to help us out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic mirror in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us if these people pass by at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that girl with the long\Nhair run by here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror just talked?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean Nami\Nhas broken out then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And is Luffy still with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I spotted her with Boss Jinbe. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's with Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get through, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's important. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's way too fast to keep up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Sanji's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you grab me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're looking\Nfor Sanji, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was here just a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where he is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to tell him that\NPudding tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was going\Nto kill him tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm worried he might fall for a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your leg? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for asking. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already aware and\Nknows about Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's known this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He only recently found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to convince him to\Nabandon the wedding and run away,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was worried about\Nthe East Blue hostages,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as putting your crew\Nin a dangerous situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the hostages Baratie guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Santi's friends are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So if they need any help, I'll go\Nthere and fight for them any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here and\NI'm not moving an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep waiting\Nfor you to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:13:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you leave me here,\NI'll just starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can take your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not eating another bite of\Nanything unless you cook it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, I don't have\Nto worry so much now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji knows what pudding is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's not being tricked by\Nher, then I've done all I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sanji's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll be seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong way to Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's how you get to the\Nrendezvous point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate to relieve\Nthis man of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be a sacrifice for\Nthe family, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't run away, the\Nwhole situation will tidy up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At the wedding tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire Vinsmoke\Nfamily will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my sight, bunch\Nof low-class pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Something hit my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you could escape, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here and\NI'm not moving an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him I'd be waiting right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Block their path!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe they're\Nattempting to surround us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cover the rear, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they all drive? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a clown, child!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, we came to help you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, really, really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, more enemies are approaching fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.15,0:17:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get inside the mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This really stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bothering you, Prometheus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When Soul King cut me, the wound went\Na lot deeper than I thought it did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's opening up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, you're so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I owe our little\Nfriend a word of praise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the first person who's ever\Nmanaged to put a scratch on one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, do you plan to keep\Nthat skeleton here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, I'm appalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really all I am to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a one-of-a-kind work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hide him away in a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead, I think I'll\Ncarry it around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, my dear,\Nyou've done well yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised to find out the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,made their way through the seducing woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now they're safely sealed\Ninside a book in the prison library.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I went there to see them; it really\Nserves them right, serves them for right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill them of\Ncourse once the weddings over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:19:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I also took the liberty of sending\Nbar mates to everyone in germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so Intoxicated, we could\Nslip anything under their noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, but you should know: raise\Nyou was snooping around me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I already took care of it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't kill her, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I feel like\Nyou don't trust me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I simply shot her in the\Nleg and erased her memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be misunderstanding somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, all this time I\Nthought you were a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.34,0:19:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our precious\Nlittle bride, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If she tries to get revenge,\Nthere could be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your concern, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But, thanks to her, I got a\Nchance to practice using my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:20:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the artificially\Nmodified people of Germa
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be able to survive a shot from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are such a clever little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, you are my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, your gunfire will\Nset my genius plan into motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's attention will\Nbe on the big wedding kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when Sanji, probably\Nwith a foolish grin on his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,will slowly lift the veil over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, much to his shock and horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He will discover you have a third eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He expected a beautiful face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But now he sees his bride for\Nthe monster that she truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be paralyzed with shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's your window of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly you'll take out your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:21:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim right between those curly eyebrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody is going to kill Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the wedding guests will be stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't move an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the people of Germa will cry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll turn around and try to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll be far too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A wall of gun barrels will\Nbe pointed at the Vinsmokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,who showed up completely unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And before they realize the danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the floor will be drenched in blood and\Nendless cacophony of gunshots fills the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,wedding hall as their bodies are pelted\Nwith bullets even after they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All six bin smokes will lie motionless\Non the floor in a pool of crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,More gunshots will sound off in salute,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's when the real\Ncelebration can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:22:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll devour the wedding cake\Nand wash it down with some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After they've been stripped of\Nthat useless leader of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can claim Germa for my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And their forces will be mine to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.34,0:22:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joe, bro, does it hurt? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is so weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inside the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed taking\Nup with such a wretched crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is treason, there's\Nno doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I had heard that you tried\Nto abandon our operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but Mama brought out the\Nroulette and you got scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I owed a serious debt\Nto Mama for protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island after\NWhitebeard passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So I believe that it was only right\Nfor me to repay her actions in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But looking at that roulette wheel,\NI could only see death and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:22:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Roulette?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You Karoo were wise not to\Nspin it, first son of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Five years ago, my partner was\Nfaced with spinning that wheel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,hoping that he might be\Nsaved from Big Mom's wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead, she stole away his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, it's designed in such a way\Nthat whoever spins it is sure to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The game's wrecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect, you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.58,0:23:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama rarely lets anyone\Nleave this place alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.44,0:23:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it's a mere trespasser or a\Ntraitorous pirate who was once in her service.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She welcomes those who come to her\Nand kills those who try to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.88,0:23:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Mama's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're wasting our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.52,0:23:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry up and find\NLuffy, Sanji, and Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drastically over the weight limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.15,0:24:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,we can confirm with\Nabsolute certainty that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the groom is fast asleep in his quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure that he doesn't\Ngo out until morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep constant watch to ensure\Nthat no one else goes in either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the groom's bed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.08,0:24:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.22,0:24:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he would be back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's got other stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to catch a few more Zs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckums was with them until\Nthey entered our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that their objective\Nis to get Sanji back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.42,0:24:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And that there were six of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:24:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,when Pudding lured them\Nto the island here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.90,0:25:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So King is with Mama, which\Nmeans that he's accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And Pedro blew himself up in\Nthe third floor courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.44,0:25:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.44,0:25:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then out of the four who\Nwent into the seducing woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.98,0:25:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we can check off the\Nrabbit and the raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.58,0:25:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,At noon, we received a\Nreport from Big Sis Barrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,telling us that she\Nhad captured them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So then that takes care of\Nfour out of the original six.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.46,0:25:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Which leaves these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.92,0:25:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They beat our big brother, Cracker,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and then managed to escape\Nfrom the seducing woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know, beyond a shadow of a doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.90,0:25:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we can find them safe and\Nsound in the prison library.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.22,0:25:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are we hearing\Nrumors that they broke free?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.96,0:26:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All before I was\Ntorturing them to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's location just\Nlike mama wanted me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't know anything useful,\Nso I had to burn them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.14,0:26:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized that I went a little too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.70,0:26:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But come on, monthor—can't you at least\Ntrust the word of your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.40,0:26:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.04,0:26:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.12,0:26:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't admit my mistake. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.76,0:26:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mama finds out, she'll take\Nthe rest of my lifespan away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.12,0:26:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.50,0:26:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about Sanji and the Vinsmokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:26:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We've confirmed that they're\Nall inside their rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:26:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everything's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.50,0:27:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the intruders have been captured,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and the preparations\Nfor tomorrow's ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.16,0:27:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,are being made in the kitchen as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.36,0:27:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's give our adorable\Nsister an incredible wedding day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.48,0:27:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make sure it all\Ngoes off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.12,0:27:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Expand your coverage and\Npatrol until morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.96,0:27:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take opera's word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.82,0:27:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, did I cook\Nthis stuff for pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.98,0:28:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I made all their favorites out of habit,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.46,0:28:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,forget them—you have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.76,0:28:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.60,0:28:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,have to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.18,0:28:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,about Luffy and the others;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.46,0:28:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll get away on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil army of Vinsmokes will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.66,0:28:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,myself included—just the\Nway Big Mom planned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If she
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.02,0:28:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,gets what she wants,\Nit'll put an end to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.02,0:28:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,even if my life was short—at\Nleast it was a fulfilling one!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.70,0:28:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, food!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.61,0:28:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.62,0:28:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a second—are you Sanji Vinsmoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:29:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My door said you were asleep in...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.22,0:29:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you were asleep in
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep waiting\Nfor you to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.58,0:29:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you leave me here,\NI'll just starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.10,0:29:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.36,0:29:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That food's not for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.02,0:29:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.94,0:29:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you run away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.18,0:29:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing?
